# SPA fallback for Netlify / Cloudflare Pages.
# React Router owns every path, but the host only has index.html on disk — a
# hard refresh on /tenants or /settings 404s without this. Vercel is covered by
# vercel.json instead; this file is harmless there.
# Static assets are served before rewrites, so /assets/* is unaffected.
/*  /index.html  200
